{"id":"a80188e1b4b9bc28","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-kurepa.md","title":"Kurepa Witness Characterization","display":"prop-kurepa-witness-characterization — Kurepa Witness Characterization","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-kurepa-witness-characterization","aliases":["58-prop-kurepa-witness-characterization","58-thm-kurepa"],"display":"prop-kurepa-witness-characterization — Kurepa Witness Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-kurepa-witness-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-kurepa-witness-characterization</span><span>58-thm-kurepa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-kurepa-witness-characterization — Kurepa Witness Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b4ea905da483052\" href=\"?note=5b4ea905da483052\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md\">../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md\">../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,T,R\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,T,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}witness\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists T\\;\\exists R\\subseteq T^2\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}witness\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists T\\;\\exists R\\subseteq T^2\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation is part of a Kurepa-tree witness, so the three-place upstream predicate must not be collapsed to a two-place call.</li>\n<li>At <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_1\\)</span> this gives the classical Kurepa hypothesis, whose existence is independent of ZFC relative to the customary consistency assumptions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md","status":"resolved","id":"5b4ea905da483052","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-kurepa-hypothesis.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,T,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}witness\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists T\\;\\exists R\\subseteq T^2\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-kurepa.md|58-thm-kurepa]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["5b4ea905da483052","a8519e320aac8e03"]}